<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id">Amos</book>
  <para style="h">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amos</para>
  <para style="mt">Amos</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Uzziah vaihawm lai leh Israel leengpa Joash tapa Jeroboam vaihawm lai a, zil kilin masang kum ni laiin Tekoa khuo a ganchingte lah a mi khat Amos in Israelte tungtang a amu thute.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Aman, “Zion akipat Mangpa ahawh a, Jerusalem akipat a aw asuo a, belamchingte gantatna munte’n asuun ua, Tualeh Karmel muol vum akieuta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tambangin Mangpa’n agen hi. “Damaska tatkhelna thum leh lite ziehin, agawtna ka heimang sih ding hi, Gilead gam buvuohna sia ha neite a avuoh zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Hazael inn ah mei ka sawl ding a, tuamin Ben Hadad leeng inn akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Damaska khopi kotpi kalna zawl ka sattan ding a, Tualeh Aven phaijang akipat in atengte leh, Beth Eden akipat in leengchieng tawipa ka sattan ding hi. Siria mite Kir ah suoh leh sal a puiin a um ding uhi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Gaza tatkhelna thum leh lite ziehin, agawtna ka heimang sih dinga, Edomte kunga piehdoh dinga, mi zousie sal a apui zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Gaza kulbang tungah mei ka sawl ding a, tuamin aleeng innpi akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ken Ashdod a tengte leh, Ashkelon a leengchieng tawipa khu ka sattan ding a, tualeh Ekron khopi tungah ka khut kaha dinga, Philistinte lah a asuohta umsunte abeimang ding uhi, Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi. “Tai-ar tatkhelna thum leh lite ziehin, agawtna ka heimang sih dinga, Saltaangte zousie Edomte kunga apiehkhiet ua, a unau kaal a thuhun atheizing lou ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Tai-ar kulbaang tungah meikuong ka sawl ding a, tua meikuongin leeng innpi akatum ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, “Edom tatkhelna thum leh lite ziehin, agawtna ka heimang sih dinga, aziehpen ama’n asanggampa namsau in anuadel a, lainatna zousie apaimanga, alungthahnain abotse ngitnget a, athangpaina asousah ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh Teman khopi tungah meikuong ka sawl dinga, tua meikuongin Bozrah leeng innpite akatum ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, “Ammon mite tatkhelna thum leh lite ziehin, agawtna ka heimang sih dinga, agamgi uh akehlet theina ding ua, Gilead gam a numei naupai laite akuikeh ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh Rabbah kulbaangah mei ka tawkuong dinga, kidouna ni a kikou aw toh, tualeh pingpei kipei ni banga huipi toh, leeng innpi akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aleengpa uh sal in akipui dinga, ama leh amiliente akipui khawm ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tambangin Mangpa’n agen hi, Moab tatkhelna thum leh lite ziehin, agawtna ka heimang sih dinga, Edom leengpa gute nangawn sunu banga ahalvam zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh Moab tungah meikuong ka sawl dinga, Kerioth leeng innpite akatum ding hi; tualeh Moab khu buoina leh kikou leh, pengkul ging husa in ashi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Alah ua akipat in thukhen vaihawmte ka satkhe ding a, tualeh ama toh pum in amiliente zousie ka thatgam ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, “Juda tatkhelna thum leh lite ziehin, agawtna ka heimang sih ding a, ama un Mangpa dan asimmaw ua, athupiehte azui sih ua, tualeh apu apate uh umdan banga azuou gente un, asuhkhelsah ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Juda tungah meikuong ka sawl dinga, tua meikuongin Jerusalem khopi a leeng innte akatum ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, “Israel tatkhelna thum leh lite ziehin, agawtna ka heimang sih ding hi, aziehpen midihtat dangka sum in azua ua, mizawng tasamte kedap bukhat akhoh ziehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mizawngte lutang lei a leivui lah ah atuonchil ua, migentheite lampi apata sawnkhete, pa leh atapa in nungah khat aluppi khawm ua, ka min siengthou asubua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maitam chinteng kunga khamna puonte tungah alum suh ua; tualeh apasien inn ua mi alieusah mante un zu adawn zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ahi, amaute masangah sidar sing banga sang leh, gangpi sing banga khau Amorte ka sumanga; Ahi, tunglam aga leh nuoilam a athahuite ka sumang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amormite gam luo dingin Izipt apat ka hing puikhie a, gamdai a kum sawmli sung hing puipa zong, Keima ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tapate ulah a mi pawlkhat guolnei in ka siemdoh a, tualeh na tangvalte ulah a pawlkhat Nazirmite dingin ka bawl hi. Aw Israel tate, tambangin ka bawl sih amah?” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hinanleh Nazirmite kungah dawnding zu na pie ua, tualeh guolneite kungah thu genlawh sih un, chi’n thu na pie uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ngai un, bawngkari buphai dimset in anetkhum bangin, noute netkhum in ka umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin taihatte ganna abei dinga, mihat in ahatna amansuo dinga, galhatpa zong amaleh ama akihumbit zou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thalpi tawi mi apang zou sih ding a, kenga taihatmi akihumbit zou sih dinga, Sakol tungtuong mi zong akihumbit zou tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin, mihat hangsan pente zong guohtangin ataimang ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel tate aw, Izipt gam a ka hing puidoh innkuonte zousie, Mangpa’n noute ahing douna tam thu ngaikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Leitunga innkuonte zousie lah ah, noute bou ka hing thei nahi ua, tuaziehin na thulimlouna zousie zieh ua, hing gawt ding ka hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Akilungtuoh sih u’leh mi ni azawhkhawm thei ding uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sa mat ding neilou in humpibahnei, gamlah ah ahumham ngai amah? Humpibahnei nou zong sa mat neiloupi in, akawhawm sung apat aham ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thang annta umlou a tuol a thang kikamte, ah va a awh thei ding amah? A awh ding umlou in tuol a thang kikamte akipeh ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khopi sunga pengkul akimut chiengin, mipite zau lou in a um ding uoi mah? Khopi sunga sietna atun chiengin, Mangpa bawl ahisih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Adihtah in Mangpa Pasian in asuoh guolneite kunga, Athuguh theisah louin bangma abawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Humpibahnei ahumhamta a, koi ahiei zau lou ding? Mangpa Pasian in thu agenta a, koi ahiei genlawh lou thei ding?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ashdod leeng innpi ah tualeh, Izipt gam leeng zousiete innpi ah thu phuong unlen, “Samaria muol tungte ah kikhawm unlen, a sunga buoina lientah leh alah ua nuoisie a umte en un,” chi un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Amaun sildih bawl dan athei sih uhi,” Mangpa’n achi hi. “A innpi huongsungte uah gumtatna leh, suomhatna akholkhawm uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi: “Gam kimkot ah melma aum nalai dinga, nou apat in na hatna uh alamang dinga, na leeng innpite uh abulu ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tambangin Mangpa’n agen hi: “Belamchingpan humpibahnei kam sung apat, belam keng ni ahiei, ahisihleh bil ni ahiei atudoh bangin, Samaria khopi ateng Israel tate lupna, ningtawnga umte leh touna sih a toute, ka hing hunkhe ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ngai unlen, Jakob innkuonte douna thu theisah un,” Galkapte Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tua ni chiengin Israelte atatkhelna ziehun ka gawt dinga, Bethel maitamte zong ka gawt ding hi, tualeh maitam kite suhtan in a um dinga tuol ah ake ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Phalbi inn khu nipi inn pumin ka suse dinga, Saiha innte amangthai ding a, tualeh inn thupite abeita ding hi” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Nou Bashan gam bawngpite, Samaria muol tunga umte mizawngte nuoisie a, mi tasamte tuonchil a, na pasalte uh kunga zu hing tawi un, dawnkhawm vai chite, tam thu ngaikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in ama siengthouna siel in akichiemta a, Ngai un, noute sia kuoika in ahing lamang dinga, na hah na suonte uh ngakuoi a ahing lahmang ni ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kulbang vangte ah pawtdoh unlen, michin ama mazawn chiet ah apei ding ua, Hermon lang ah paidoh nahi ding uhi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Bethel ah hing pei unlen, takhiel un, Gilgal ah hing pei unlen, tatkhelna pung sah un, zingmawng chin in na kithoinate uh lan unlen, na sawm ua khatte uh ni thum chin teng in hing tawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kipah thugenna sillat tol kisawte lan unlen, ut thu a silpiehte phuong unlen, theisah un; Aw nou Israel tate, tam khu na utlamtah uh ahi,” Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Na khopi zousie uah ha sienna ka hing pie a, tualeh na umna teng uah tanghou tahsapna ka hing pie a, hinanleh ka kungah na hing kile kia sih uhi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Bu lahna ding ha thum asap laiin, na tung ua guo zu ding zong ka tutang a, khopi khat tungah guo ka zusah a, khopi dang tungah ka zusah sih a, Lou khattungah guo azu a, lou dangin guo mu lou in, avuoi gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin khopi ni leh thum a mite, khopi dang ah tui du in aban tai ua, hinanleh dangta phatna khop amu sih uhi; hinanleh ka kungah nang kinuale nuom sih uhi.” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Gawna hui leh muotna in ka hing gawt a, na huonte uh, na grep huonte uh, na theipi kungte u’leh na Olive kungte uh, ahing let sem sem chiengin, khaupheten anetum sieng ua, hinanleh ka kungah na hing kinuale nai tuom sih uhi.” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Izipt gam a bangin na lah uah gawtna ka hing sawl a, na khanglaite uh namsau in ka that a, na sakol matte uh pumin ka that khawm a; tualeh na giehphuol uite uh na nahkohawm ua, namse khop in ka bawl a, hinanleh ka kungah na hing kinuale sih uhi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Pasian in Sodom leh Gomorrah khopite alumlet bangin, noute pawlkhat ka hing lumlet a, meikuong lai a singkhuo katum ding lahdoh bang nahi uhi; hinanleh ka kungah na hing kinuale na lailai sih uhi.” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tuazieh in, Aw Israel, na tung uah tambangin ka bawl ding hi, tualeh na tung ua tambanga ka bawl ding ziehin, Aw Israel, na Pasian tuoh dingin kimansa in um in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai un, muol leh tangte bawlpa leh hui siempa, mihingte kunga angaituonate gendohpa, zingmawng zong miel sahpa leh, leitung mun sangte akengtaw a tuonpa khu, amin galkapte Mangpa Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel innkuonte aw, noute dou a ka thugen, ka kaala na ngaiun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel nungah siengthou apuata, athou zou nawn sih ding hi. Ama gam sung ah taisan in alum a, ama phong ding koima a um sih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa Pasian in tambang in agen hi: “Galdou ding a mi tul khat pawtdohna khopi in, za khat anuasie dinga, mi za khat pawtdoh na khopi in, mi sawm khat Israel innkuonte kungah nuasie ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Israel innkuonte kungah, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Kei hing sui unlen tualeh hing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Bethel suisih unlen, Gilgal ah lut sih unlen, Beersheba ah galkai sih un; aziehpen Gilgal sal a puimangin a um dinga, Bethel zong bangmalou ahing hi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa sui unlen tualeh hing un, Tuachilou in Ama mei bangin akuong dinga, Joseph innkuonte akatum ding hi. Tualeh aphel ding Bethel khosungah koima a um sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nou vaihawmnadih gamsai khatah suoh sah a, dihtatna tuol sena neite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawmluoi leh zuheisuhtun siem a, shina lim zingmawng suohsahpa leh, sun zong zan banga mielsahpa Ama suiun; Tuipituite hankhawma, leitunga guo a zusahpa Ama sui un, Amin khu Mangpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman mihatte tungah sietna guobang in azusah a, Khopi kulpite tungah sietna keh bangin akesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaun kul kotpi a thuhil mite amuda ua, dihtah a thugen mite akidah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin nouten mizawngte na tuonchil ua, ama ua pat in tangseute na lahpieh ua. Suongkhenthawin innte lam nan u’lachin, asungah na teng sih ding uhi, Grep huon hoitahte na bawl ua, hinanleh grep zu na dawn tuom sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen na tatkhelna uh tampite leh, na khelna thupitahte uh ka thei a, midihtatte na sugenthei ua, golguhnate na la ua, kulkotpi ah mizawngte tan ding na lehei pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin tua hun chiengin mi pilvangte asip dide ding uhi, hun hoilou ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na hin theina dingun, silhoi sui unlen, silhoilou sui sih un. Tuachi’n na gen bangun, galkapte Mangpa Pasian in ahing umpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Silhoilou huo unlen, Silhoi bawl un; Kulkotpi ah thukhenna dih tungkhie un; tuachi’n Joseph innkuonte lah a damsunte dingin galkapte, Mangpa Pasian in hepina anei kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuazieh in Mangpa Pasian galkapte, Mangpa’n tami agen hi: “Kholai chinteng ah ka leh mauna a um dinga, lamlien dungte ah, khohna e! Khohna e! achi ding ua, asuun dingin lou bawl mite ahan ding ua, akap dingin kaasiemte ahan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Grep huon tengah ka leh mauna a um ding hi, aziehpen na lah uh tawnsuoh in kei ka hing pei ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nou Mangpa ni hing tunkal ngahlate, na tung uh agih hi. Mangpa ni khu noute dinga bang phatuom ding ahiei? Tam khu miel ahia, vah ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi khat humpibahnei akipat tai nanleh, vompi toh kituoh bang ding ahia, ahisihleh inn a pei in, banga akhut ngam a, gul in ana tuh bang ding hi uteh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa ni khu vah ahisih a, mielna hilou ahiei mah? Avahna nangawn taanglou a, miel keikui ding hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Na pawite uh ka hua a, ka kidah hi, tualeh na khawmpi siengthoute uh tungah zong ka kipah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Halmang sillatte leh ann sillatte hing lan nan u’lachin, ka sang sih ding hi; na bawngnou vahthaute uh, kilemna sillat a na latte u’zong ka pahta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na lasah bil aphuoite uh kei akipat lamang un, aziehpen na pehging guineite uh, ging kilawmte ka ngaikhe sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh thukhenna dih tui bangin luongsah unlen, tualeh dihtatna khu tuipi hattah bangin luongsah zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Aw Israel innkuonte gamdai ah kum sawmli sung, ka kungah kithoina leh sillatte na hing lankhata uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na kibawlthu uh na leengpa uh Sikkuth leh na Chiun milimte uh, tualeh na Aasi pasiente uh na kipuoh kawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin Damaska khel lam ah, noute sal in ka hing puisah ding hi,” Amin galkapte Pasian, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Nou Zion a nuomtah a umte leh, Samaria muol a muonna ngate, namte lu pen chi a um mi thupite, akung ua Israel innkuonte hing hawnate, na tung uh agih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kalneh khuo galkai unlen, va en un; tualeh khuna kipat in Hamath khothupitah ah haw un, tuazou chiengin Philistinte khopi Gath ah hawsuh un. Tam leenggamte sangin, noute na hoizaw uh amah? Ahisihleh amaute gam sangin noute gam athupi zaw amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sietna ni gamla sah a, gumtatna vaihawmna ni naisah noute na tung uh gih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Saiha lupna tunga lum a, toupha sau nuom tunga kizie a, belamhon lah a belamnoute ne a, bawngbuh apat bawngtuoi sa tuitah tah nete nahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David banga kaiging tum a, tumging toh kituoh a lasa a, tumging vanzah ding kibawlte na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Noutunga zu dawn a, sathau hoipente kinute na hi ua, Hinanleh Joseph thuohgimna dapiloute na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin sal a pei masate toh tuin apei ding ua; tualeh kize ngeingui a, annkuongluina nopsahna lahmang ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian Ama min sielin akichiemta a, galkapte Mangpa Pasian in, “Jakob kiletsahna ka kidah a, tualeh aleeng innpite ka huo hi; tuazieh in khopi leh a sunga um zousie, mite khut ah ka pedoh ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n tambang ahing hi ding hi, inn khat ah mi sawm um nalai ta u’leh ashi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh tua mishi khat pen ahieng asan khat in, mishi gute hal dingin, tua inn apat mishi luong la a apuohkhiet chiengin, Inn sunga umpa kungah, “Na kungah mi dang a um nalai ei”? achi dinga, Tuachi’n koi ahiei mikhat in “Umlou” achi ding hi. Tualeh aman “Sip khinkhian in Mangpa min ilou sih ding hi,” achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Ngai un, Mangpa’n thu apie hi: Aman inn thupi achim guoisah sieng a, inn neute asunen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Suongpi tungah sakolte atai ngai amah? Mi’n suongpi tungah bawngtal in lou akaisah ngai amah? Hinanleh adih a vaihawmna shina gu na suohsahta ua, tualeh dihtatna ga gamsaikha na suoh sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Noute Lo Debar tungah na kipah ua, “Eima hatna zieh a Karnaim ikilah uh ahi na chi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel innkuonte aw, “Ngai un, nouma dou dingin nam khat ka dingsah ding hi,” Tualeh amauten “Lebo Hamath lutna kipat in, Arabah phaijang tan dong ahing sugenthei ding uhi.” Galkapte Mangpa Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tambangin Mangpa Pasian in kei ahing ensah a, Ngai vawi, haichi nukhia pen poudoh chiillai in Aman khauphe hon a um sah a, Ahi leengpa haichi lahkhawm dan in tam khu haichi pou nukhia pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh khauphehon in gam sunga loupa anehkhawng nua un, “Ken, Aw Mangpa Pasian ngaidam in, Kang ngen ahi! Jakob bang achi din zou diei? Ama lah aneunalai ngal a,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n tami tungtangah Mangpa’n alungsim ahei a, “Tami kibawl nawn sih va,” Mangpa’n achi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tambangin Mangpa Pasian in Kei ahing ensah a, Ngai vawi, Mangpa Pasian in sugenthei dingin mei ahan a, tua mei in tuipi thuhpite ahalkanga, gam zong akatum siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n “Ke’n Aw Mangpa Pasian tawpsah photin, Kang ngen ahi! Jakob bang achi din zou diei? Ama lah aneu nalai ngal a,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n tami tungtangah zong, Mangpa’n alungsim ahei a; “Tami kibawl nawn sih va,” Mangpa’n achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tambangin Ama’n Kei ahing ensah a: Ngai vawi, Mangpa khu tena sialum khau toh kibawl kulbang tungah adinga, akhut ah vaukhau khat atawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Amos bang na mu ei?” ahing chi hi? “Ken sialumkhau” ka chi hi. Tuachi’n Mangpa’n, “Ngai vawi, ka mi Israelte lah ah sialumkhau ka khai dinga, amauh ka pel nawn sih ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isak mun sangte ka sumang dinga, Israel mun siengthoute susiet in a um ding hi. Jeroboam innkuonte namsau in ka dou ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Bethel siempu Amaziahin Israel leengpa Jeroboam kungah mi asawl a, tambang in agen sah hi, “Amos in Israel innkuonte lah ah nang douna in thu aphiela athugen zousie gamsungin athuoh thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Amos in tambangin agen hi: Jeroboam namsau in ashi dinga, Amau’gam ngei a kipat in, Israel sal a pui ahi ngeingei ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amaziah in Amos kungah “Aw nang guolnei, pei inlen, Juda gam ah taimang inlen, khunah neh ding thalaw in thu vagen lawh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Bethel ah thugen nawn sin, aziehpen tam mun pen leengpa munsiengthou ahi a, leengpa tenna innpi ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amos in adawng a, Amaziah kungah, “Kei guolnei ka hisih a, Guolnei tapa zong ka hisih hi, kei ganhon ching mi leh theipiga lakhawm mi ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachia belamhon ka zui laiin, Mangpa’n ahing ladohta a, tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah, Pei inlen, ka mi Israelte kungah thu vagenin, ahing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tuaziehin tuin Mangpa thu na ngaiin Nangman, Israel douna in thu gen sinlen, Isaak innkuonte douna thu sekhe sin na hing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuazieh in Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, Na zi khopi ah akizua dinga, na tapate leh na tanute namsau a thain a um ding ua, na gam tena khau a hawmzah in a um dinga, Nangma zong gam sienglou ah na shi ding a, Tualeh Israelte zong amauh gam ngei ua kipat in, sal a puimangin a um ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian in tambangin ahing ensah hi, Ngai vawi, nipi lai theiga law khat ana kilui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman ka kungah, “Amos bang na mu ei?” ahing chi hi. Tuachi’n “Ken nipi lai theiga min law sunga um ka mu hi,” ka chi hi. “Ka mi Israelte tungah atawpna ahing tungta hi; amauh ka peipel nawn sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuani chiengin biehinn a la kisate Kalemauna asuoh ding a,” “Mun chinteng ah mishi luong tampi sip dide a paithang ahi ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami Ngai un, nou tasamte tuonchil a, gam sunga mi zawngte lawsam sahte aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Bu izua theina ding ua, bangchih chienga ha tha bei dinga; tualeh ibu ikhoh theina dinga, bangchih chienga khawlni bei ding ahiei? Chi kawm in, Ephah na suneu ua, shekel na sulien ua lepchietah in tena dihlou na zang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dangka a mizawngte ilei thei a, tasamte kedap bu khat ilei thei a, bu hoiloute nangawn izua theina dingin na chi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa Jakob kiletsahna siel in akichiem a, “Pellouin anasepte uh khat zong ka manghil ngai sih ding achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam ziehin gam sung kiling in asunga, tengte chintengin asuun sih ding amah? Nile luipi bangin gam buppi akhang dinga, Izipt luipi banga khangin akiemsuh kia ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tualeh khum ni chiengin” hichi ahing hi ding hi; “Suntanglai in ni ka tumsah dinga, tualeh suntanglai ma in leitung ka mielsah ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na pawi bawlte uh sunna ka suoh sah dinga, na late zousie uh kaala ka suohsah dinga, kawng chintengin sai ip puon ka tengsah dinga, lutang chinteng tung ah lukieuna ka tungsah ding hi; tapa tang neisun asuun bangin ka bawl ding a, tualeh atawpna khatna ni ka bangsah ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ngai vawi, Mangpa Pasian in nite hing tung ding ahita,” “Gam sung ah kielna ka tungsah ding, Ann du a kielna hilouin, tui du a kielna zong hilouin, Hinanleh Mangpa thu zahna lunggulna lam a kielna, ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuipi a kipat tuipi dang khat dong, Mallam akipat suolam dongah avah kawi kawi ding ua, Mangpa thu sui in asuhvah atouvah ding ua, hinanleh amu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin nungah siengthou melhoite leh, tangval thahat laite dangta in apua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samaria khelna lou a kichiem miten, Dan aw, na pasien ahin laisie! Tualeh Beersheba umdan ahin laisie! chizousie apua ding ua, athou kia nawn sih ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maitam kunga Mangpa ding ka mu a, “Aman, kotpi khuomte sat in innhim khuomte, akilin theina ding un abawn in alu ah sattan in tualeh, Ken anukhia pente namsau in ka that ding hi. Amaute lah akipat taikhie koima asuohta sih ding ua, asuohta sun zong hutkhiet ahisih ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mishi khuo tan tousuh nan u’leh, khuna pat in amaute ka khutin ka lakhetou dinga, van ah kaltou nan u’leh, khuna pat in ka luoikhesuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Karmel muol tungah kiphuol nan u’leh, ka suidoh dinga khuna pat in ka ladoh ding hi; Ka muphahlou dingin tuipi tawdop ah kibu nan u’leh, khuna pat in gulpi thu ka pe dinga, amauh ava tu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Agalte uh masangah saltaang dingin pei nan u’leh, khuna kipat namsau thu ka pe dinga, amauh athat ding hi. Ahoina ding uh hilou in asietna dingun, amauh tungah ka mit ka tusah ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa Pasian, Ama ngel in leitung atham a azunta a, asunga tengte zousie in asun uhi; Gam pumpi Nile luipi bangin akhang dinga, Izipt luipi bangin akiemsuh kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vanlaizawl adan adan a chieldaw banga dawpa, leitung athuop athuop a mukhepa, tuipi tuite hankhetou a, leitunga maikai a guo a zusahpa, Amin khu Mangpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Israel tate aw! noute kei a dingin, Ethiopia mite bang na hisih uh amah?’ Mangpa’n achi hi. Izipt gam akipat Israel puidohlou ka mah? Kaphtor akipat Philistinte, tualeh Kir akipat Siria mite puidohlou ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai vawi, Mangpa Pasian mit khu leenggam giloute tungah atu hi, tualeh leitung maikai apat in ka sumang dinga, hinanleh Jakob innkuonte ka sumang sieng sih ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Aziehpen pellou in, Keima’n thu ka pe dinga, lawpi a bu akisep bangin, namte lah ah Israel innkuonte ka sep ding, hinanleh atang neupen nangawn tuol ah akesih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuohsietna in ahing delpha sih ding a, ahing maituo sam sih ding hi, chite; ka mite lah a mikhielte zousie namsau in ashi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tua ni chiengin David biehbuh chimsa ka tungding dinga, asietna munte ka siemtha dinga, apuasate ka phongtou dinga, nidanglai a bangin ka lamtha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Edom gam a asuohta umsunte leh ka min a kihan Jentel zousie anei thei ding uhi,” Mangpa tam silte bawlpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ngai vawi, nite hing tung ding hita,” Mangpa’n achi hi. Loukaipa’n bu atpa adelphah hun chiengin, Grep chilpa in achi thepa adelpha ding hi; tualeh muol leh taangte’n grep zu humtah atakhesah ding a, muol zousiete akipat aluongkhe zengzung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mi Israelte asaltanna uapat in ka puikia dinga, khopi sesate alam tha ding ua, asungah ateng ding uhi; Grep guite asuon ding ua, uoin adawn ding uhi, huonte zong abawl ding ua, agate ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaute agam uah ka suon dinga, amauh ka piehsa gam apat in, koima’n abawtdoh nawn sih ding hi, Mangpa na Pasian un achi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
